      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Will the IRS file a tax lien if I'm in CNC?</summary>
        <p>Possibly. The IRS may still file a Notice of Federal Tax Lien to protect their interest in your assets, even while collections are paused. However, they won't actively seize assets while you're in CNC status.</p>
